cial_rank":"州级长官","source_snippet":"益州刺史張喬","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"39c94d9d-8e09-4d07-8d35-931241c11d5f"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"從事","official_note":"从事是汉代州级长官的属官，协助处理政务或军事事务，此处杨竦作为从事被派遣领兵平定叛乱，显示了其在地方行政中的辅助和军事执行角色。","official_rank":"州级属官","source_snippet":"從事楊竦","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"ae9353ff-6b6d-4ce2-ba28-b5ecb2fad94a"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"長吏","official_note":"长吏泛指地方长官或高级官吏，此处指那些侵犯蛮夷的官员，杨竦奏报他们的罪行，反映了长吏在地方治理中的权力和可能的滥用。","official_rank":"县级或以上官员","source_snippet":"長吏姦猾","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"7849a010-0896-42b9-a1df-e21b27952dbb"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張喬","people_name_jianti_auto":"张乔","people_xingming":"张乔","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa3a-db0e-11ef-8421-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"楊竦","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨竦","people_xingming":"杨竦","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa3b-db0e-11ef-b8c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"封離","people_name_jianti_auto":"封离","people_xingming":"封离","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa3e-db0e-11ef-aab5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"封離","people_name_jianti_auto":"封离","people_xingming":"封离","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa3f-db0e-11ef-bcb3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"竦","people_name_jianti_auto":"竦","people_xingming":"杨竦","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa40-db0e-11ef-96f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"竦","people_name_jianti_auto":"竦","people_xingming":"杨竦","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa41-db0e-11ef-b93c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"竦","people_name_jianti_auto":"竦","people_xingming":"杨竦","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa42-db0e-11ef-a1ff-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"95fc2331-db0e-11ef-9e8c-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yè","source_anchor_text":"竦將兵至楪榆擊封離","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":16,"text":"楪","tongjian_id":"71b2f9e8-1aa0-5d24-86f2-f3579d2b7207"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"益州","place_name_jianti_auto":"益州","resolved_place_entity_id":204,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa3c-db0e-11ef-9837-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楪榆","place_name_jianti_auto":"楪榆","resolved_place_entity_id":7543,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa3d-db0e-11ef-8e9b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十五、大理府（卷一百十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋亦曰楪榆县。宋、齐因之，后废。又东河阳废县，亦在府东。...","context_before":"...反。后汉建武十八年，叶榆、弄栋诸种叛，杀长吏，寻讨平之。","source_end_index":124,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"142c993b-b327-5879-bc10-7c413316d440","source_start_index":82,"source_text":"元初六年，永昌诸郡蛮复叛，益州刺史张乔遣从事杨竦将兵至叶榆，败蛮酋封离等，尽平其党。"}],"path":"云南方舆纪要/十五、大理府（卷一百十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","内政"],"content":"11益州刺史張喬遣從事楊竦將兵至楪榆，擊封離等，大破之，斬首三萬餘級，獲生口千五百人。封離等惶怖，斬其同謀渠帥，詣竦乞降。竦厚加慰納，其餘三十六種皆來降附。竦因奏長吏姦猾，侵犯蠻夷者九十人，皆減死論。","content_fanyi":"益州刺史张乔派遣从事杨竦领兵到达楪榆县，进攻封离等人，大破其众，斩首三万余级，俘获一千五百人。封离等人十分惶恐，杀死一同谋反的其他首领，前往杨竦处请求投降。杨竦厚加抚慰、接纳了他们，其余三十六个部落都前来归降归附。杨竦因此上奏，举发奸诈狡猾、侵犯蛮夷的长吏九十人，全部按减死罪论处。","content_jianti_auto":"11益州刺史张乔遣从事杨竦将兵至楪榆，击封离等，大破之，斩首三万余级，获生口千五百人。封离等惶怖，斩其同谋渠帅，诣竦乞降。竦厚加慰纳，其余三十六种皆来降附。竦因奏长吏奸猾，侵犯蛮夷者九十人，皆减死论。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4127,"number":11,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"95fc2331-db0e-11ef-9e8c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":8,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"事見上卷永初元年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"95c50a68-db0e-11ef-b8d3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事見上卷永初元年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见上卷永初元年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa44-db0e-11ef-8084-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"役使而臣屬之。復，扶又翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"役使而臣属之。复，扶又翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa45-db0e-11ef-9cbd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"敦煌","place_name_jianti_auto":"敦煌","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa48-db0e-11ef-9860-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索姓出敦煌。又左傳，商人七族有索氏。上，時掌翻。索，昔各翻。上遣者，上奏而遣之也。行長史者，行長史事，未爲眞也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索姓出敦煌。又左传，商人七族有索氏。上，时掌翻。索，昔各翻。上遣者，上奏而遣之也。行长史者，行长史事，未为真也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa47-db0e-11ef-b06b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"敦煌太守","official_note":"敦煌太守是汉代地方行政官职，负责敦煌郡的治理和边防，此处曹宗作为敦煌太守，因西域问题而上报朝廷。","official_rank":"郡守级（约二千石）","source_snippet":"敦煌太守曹宗患之","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"c2fe3ca0-e8da-4b79-a6e6-48128bbcc4e3"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"行長史","official_note":"行長史是汉代临时或代理的長史官职，常负责军事或行政事务，此处索班被派遣率军屯驻伊吾以招抚西域诸国。","official_rank":"高级属官（约比二千石）","source_snippet":"上遣行長史索班將千餘人屯伊吾以招撫之","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"62d79604-a0f0-4a35-a750-8862e8fddfb4"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-100,"link_death_year":-91,"link_td_description":"曹宗，西汉末代平阳侯，曹参五世孙，曹窋的玄孙，曹奇的曾孙，曹时的孙子，曹襄的儿子，生母为卫长公主。","link_td_id":"Q10012752","link_td_number_id":1502734,"people_name":"曹宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"曹宗","people_xingming":"曹宗","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa4e-db0e-11ef-8c99-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"索班","people_name_jianti_auto":"索班","people_xingming":"索班","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa50-db0e-11ef-9795-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"車師前王","people_name_jianti_auto":"车师前王","people_xingming":"车师前王","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa52-db0e-11ef-b35a-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[新疆吐鲁番]"},{"people_name":"鄯善王","people_name_jianti_auto":"鄯善王","people_xingming":"鄯善王","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa53-db0e-11ef-bcce-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"西域","place_name_jianti_auto":"西域","resolved_place_entity_id":259,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa4b-db0e-11ef-a5e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":10,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa4c-db0e-11ef-9557-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"北匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":943,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa4d-db0e-11ef-b547-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"敦煌","place_name_jianti_auto":"敦煌","resolved_place_entity_id":334,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa4f-db0e-11ef-93f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾","resolved_place_entity_id":1031,"start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa51-db0e-11ef-bff8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与西域各国的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0614"},{"title":"东汉与匈奴的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0608"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"永建四年，以伊吾膏腴地，旁近西域，匈奴资之为钞暴，乃复开...","context_before":"...。四年，中郎将任尚屯伊吾。永初元年，复罢伊吾庐屯田吏士。","source_end_index":198,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"eca1e0a3-5547-5b13-875f-5b0e378ccd89","source_start_index":147,"source_text":"元初六年，以西域附北匈奴，共为边患。敦煌太守曹宗奏遣行长史索班复屯伊吾。既而为北匈奴及车师后王所攻没。"},{"context_after":"延光二年，班勇击匈奴于前王庭，破走之。其后渐与中国绝。晋...","context_before":"...，窦宪遣兵复取伊吾庐地。车师震警，于是前后王各遣子入侍。","source_end_index":605,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2f876e71-3177-59d6-bc3a-0570328209f6","source_start_index":581,"source_text":"元初末，北匈奴率车师后王击走前王，以其属于汉也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"12初，西域諸國旣絕於漢，北匈奴復以兵威役屬之，與共爲邊寇。敦煌太守曹宗患之，乃上遣行長史索班將千餘人屯伊吾以招撫之。於是車師前王及鄯善王復來降。","content_fanyi":"当初，西域各国与汉朝断绝关系后，北匈奴又用武力逼迫役使它们臣属自己，并与它们共同在汉朝边境侵扰为害。敦煌太守曹宗为此担忧，就奏请朝廷派遣代理长史索班率领一千余人屯驻伊吾，以招抚西域各国。于是车师前王与鄯善王又前来归降。","content_jianti_auto":"12初，西域诸国既绝于汉，北匈奴复以兵威役属之，与共为边寇。敦煌太守曹宗患之，乃上遣行长史索班将千余人屯伊吾以招抚之。于是车师前王及鄯善王复来降。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4128,"number":12,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa43-db0e-11ef-b6d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"安國","people_name_jianti_auto":"安国","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa56-db0e-11ef-80d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"臣磐","people_name_jianti_auto":"臣磐","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa57-db0e-11ef-8976-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"月氏王","people_name_jianti_auto":"月氏王","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa58-db0e-11ef-935a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"遺腹","people_name_jianti_auto":"遗腹","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa59-db0e-11ef-a2de-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"臣磐","people_name_jianti_auto":"臣磐","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa5a-db0e-11ef-92ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"臣磐","people_name_jianti_auto":"臣磐","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa5b-db0e-11ef-8833-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"遺腹","people_name_jianti_auto":"遗腹","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa5c-db0e-11ef-90ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"臣磐","people_name_jianti_auto":"臣磐","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa5d-db0e-11ef-a96f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"月氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"月氏","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa5e-db0e-11ef-9902-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"月氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"月氏","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa5f-db0e-11ef-808c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"疏勒","place_name_jianti_auto":"疏勒","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa60-db0e-11ef-a790-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"月氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"月氏","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa61-db0e-11ef-8cb0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"西域傳曰：元初中，安國以舅臣磐有罪，徙於月氏，月氏王親愛之。遺腹旣立，月氏遣兵送臣磐還疏勒。國人素敬愛臣磐，又畏憚月氏，卽共奪遺腹印綬，迎臣磐，立以爲王。氏，音支。","note_content_jianti_auto":"西域传曰：元初中，安国以舅臣磐有罪，徙于月氏，月氏王亲爱之。遗腹既立，月氏遣兵送臣磐还疏勒。国人素敬爱臣磐，又畏惮月氏，即共夺遗腹印绶，迎臣磐，立以为王。氏，音支。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa55-db0e-11ef-9854-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"明帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"明帝","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa64-db0e-11ef-8fdd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"莎車","place_name_jianti_auto":"莎车","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa65-db0e-11ef-a46a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"于窴","place_name_jianti_auto":"于窴","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa66-db0e-11ef-9b87-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自明帝永平四年，莎車屬于窴。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自明帝永平四年，莎车属于窴。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa63-db0e-11ef-bc38-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"疏勒王","official_note":"疏勒王是西域疏勒国的君主，属于地方政权首领。在《资治通鉴》中，此处描述疏勒王去世后王位继承问题，反映了西域诸国的政治变动。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"疏勒王安國死","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"e9889369-f9b8-4bcc-a0b4-9c72de3e3da3"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"疏勒王","people_name_jianti_auto":"疏勒王","people_xingming":"安国","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"95fcfa67-db0e-11ef-8fad-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":